{
  "disclosures": [
    "Development-scoped evaluation on the human-reviewed pilot/dev Golden Dataset (review-2). It is development / rubric-calibration data, not held-out test evidence; no held-out performance claim is permitted.",
    "Recorded retrieval runs: the ranked lists are the top-20 source runs in the unsealed pool provenance, recorded before labelling and scored here with the newly frozen human labels. No retrieval was re-run and no latency was measured.",
    "Not official M10 completion. rrf_k and the embedding model are not re-decided here; any recommendation drawn from these results is development-scoped.",
    "Pooled recall: the denominator counts only the relevant pairs in the judged pool (pool-1), so recall is biased upward where more products are relevant than were pooled.",
    "V3-d10 at K=20: ranks 11-20 of the depth-10 lists were not reranked and keep the fused V2 order, so V3-d10@20 mixes reranked and unreranked results.",
    "Unjudged results count as not relevant and are counted separately (unjudged@K). Every evaluated list was pooled, so unjudged@K is expected to be 0; it is computed, not assumed.",
    "Label limitations (see docs/golden-dataset-m9.md): the primary annotator (ann-1) saw machine label proposals and was AI-assisted on the rubric; blindness was procedural; inter-annotator agreement describes the cs-1 sample only; optional adjudication candidates were not re-adjudicated.",
    "Small slices: the pilot has few Hinglish and noisy queries; per-query and per-slice values are anecdotes, not estimates. No significance test is run.",
    "The machine-label provisional M10 analysis (docs/m10-provisional-evaluation.md) is separate historical evidence and is not combined with these results."
  ],
